The transformer switches between three behaviors.

@macro < 0.5: everything below threshold is zero, and the remainder is scaled
@macro = 0.5: no clipping
@macro > 0.5: boosts and clamps everything above abs(x) = 1

The transformer interpolates between three behaviors.

@macro 0: scales from [-1, 1] to [0, 1]
@macro 0.5: half-wave rectifies
@macro 1: fully rectifies
